# The API is not deployed here; it runs on Render (see render.yaml).
#
# Vercel treats any file under api/ as a serverless function whether or not
# vercel.json mentions it, so without this the portal would be deployed
# alongside a second API — one with no database configured, answering the same
# /api paths. Removing the file instead would lose the option of running the
# whole thing on Vercel, which this keeps.
api/
server/
